  biomeName: The Lava Seam
  minDepthMeters: 14000
  maxDepthMeters: 15000
  shortDescription: A continuous river of fire flowing through the abyss.
  isPlaceholder: 0
  visitPurpose: Late-game pressure biome. Come here only for major progress, rare
    extraction, and to work around bowls, pools, and local hotspots.
  commonRewardHook: Even routine value here comes from Abyssal Crystal and Thermal
    Gel.
  rareRewardHook: 'The reason to risk the trip is: Tungsten Chunk and Abyss Pressure
    Shell.'
  landmarkIdentity: The Lava Seam reads through bowls, pools, domes, and hotspot
    basins. Landmarks should feel singular and intimidating.
  safePocketIdentity: Safe pockets are rare and temporary. Retreat routes matter
    more than comfort.
  riskSummary: 'Main failure mode: localized danger pockets and hostile basins, depth
    stress, and expensive hesitation. Creature pressure stays extreme.'
  extractionFocus: 'High-risk extraction under thermal and survival pressure. Deep
    tier: expect basin pockets, salvage traps, and local hotspots, extract only what
    justifies the risk, and leave cleanly.'
  landmarkGuidance: Dominant landmark is magma seam or hadal chimney crown. This
    slot should read through red-black catastrophic skyline; use bowls and hotspot
    rims to remember loops.
